t value on Thursday, Nov-5.","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2118461023808323957"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/m725rhhdt7a38zdd3aappeofn","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"m725rhhdt7a38zdd3aappeofn","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/m725rhhdt7a38zdd3aappeofn","published_at":"2026-11-05T20:21:15Z","ref":"A4","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"X：Fei-Fei Li (@drfeifei, World Labs)","summary":"李飞飞转发 World Labs 官方账号，宣传其新发布的 Frameboy demo，可用于实时探索世界。Frameboy 是两个月前发布的自回归世界模型 Atlas 的高度优化版本，从云端 GPU 流式传输，最高可达 15 fps，支持像素级相机控制。","title":"李飞飞宣传 World Labs 发布 Frameboy，可实时体验 Atlas 世界模型","title_en":"Real time Atlas! Try it now! 🚀","url":"https://x.com/drfeifei/status/2118438515474374904"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/vkfrtci1ufbtbydsqersys6lx","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"vkfrtci1ufbtbydsqersys6lx","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/vkfrtci1ufbtbydsqersys6lx","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:51:52Z","ref":"A5","score":82,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"美国中期选举民主党拿下参众两院，多场竞选以问责 AI 公司为主题，行业面临监管、数据中心建设放缓等前景。44 项地方数据中心暂停提案中 43 项通过，NBC 民调显示 76% 选民反对在社区建数据中心；专家称共和党禁止州级 AI 限制的尝试可能终结，OpenAI 和 Anthropic 未置评，据华尔街日报报道 CEO 们在私下讨论算力容量受限问题。","title":"美国中期选举蓝潮冲击 AI 行业，44 项数据中心暂停提案中 43 项通过","title_en":"‘Total repudiation’: The blue wave is about to hit AI","url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1026927/total-repudiation-the-blue-wave-is-about-to-hit-ai"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/wkgcal7l9pkj3g7w8ohlp3c45","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"wkgcal7l9pkj3g7w8ohlp3c45","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/wkgcal7l9pkj3g7w8ohlp3c45","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:05:47Z","ref":"A6","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"X：Perplexity (@perplexity_ai)","summary":"Perplexity 推出 Teammates 功能，这些智能体可承接任务，利用 Computer tasks、skills、memory 和工具主动工作。Teammates 之间可相互协作，还能在 Slack 中给同事发消息，目前已向 Max 订阅用户开放网页版。","title":"Perplexity 推出 Teammates 智能体，面向 Max 订阅用户开放","title_en":"Introducing teammates.","url":"https://x.com/perplexity_ai/status/2118389326459670825"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/yjwroxww17lcg4ntcu9ruo105","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"yjwroxww17lcg4ntcu9ruo105","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/yjwroxww17lcg4ntcu9ruo105","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:00:00Z","ref":"A7","score":74,"selected":true,"source":"Google Blog：AI（RSS）","summary":"Google 发布 Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash，在 Gemini API 和 Gemini for business 全面开放。新模型原生支持最长 15 秒视频生成（此前为 10 秒），支持多轮对话编辑和更强的参考图一致性，价格较 1.1 下降 30% 至 720p 视频 $0.07/秒。","title":"Google 发布 Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash：15 秒视频生成，降价 30% 至 $0.07/秒","title_en":"Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash: Fast and cost-effective with longer clips","url":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/introducing-gemini-omni-1-2-flash/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/mpv0jfejdzdm2336jgtyj9tde","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"mpv0jfejdzdm2336jgtyj9tde","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/mpv0jfejdzdm2336jgtyj9tde","published_at":"2026-11-05T17:00:00Z","ref":"A8","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"Reflection Blog","summary":"Reflection 发布博文，讲解其开源权重模型 Beam 的安全训练与评估方法，并推出开源安全研究计划 Project Iris。Beam 在 Iris Safety Evaluations 对话任务中拒绝 89% 的有害请求，为所测开源权重模型中最高，同时遵守 82% 的安全相关无害请求；安全对齐教师模型从 100B 增至 501B 参数后，过度拒绝相对下降 48.7%。","title":"Reflection 详解开源模型 Beam 的安全训练与评估方法","title_en":"Open model safety: lessons from training and evaluating Beam","url":"https://reflection.ai/blog/open-model-safety-lessons"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/kl8ufrhv3zm38108gy2d7mins","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"kl8ufrhv3zm38108gy2d7mins","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/kl8ufrhv3zm38108gy2d7mins","published_at":"2026-11-05T16:33:21Z","ref":"A9","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"X：Mustafa Suleyman（Microsoft AI CEO） (@mustafasuleyman)","summary":"Mustafa Suleyman 表示对特拉华州允许 AI 智能体经营企业的提案深感担忧，认为应非常谨慎。该提案拟设立名为 Delaware AIC 的独立法律实体，其日常事务由 AI 智能体而非人类管理，可依智能体指示以自身名义起诉应诉、持有和处置财产并承担债务。","title":"Mustafa Suleyman 对特拉华允许 AI 智能体经营企业的提案表示担忧","title_en":"Deeply concerning to me... Delaware proposal to let agents run businesees... we should be very cautious here","url":"https://x.com/mustafasuleyman/status/2118381163136123019"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/t5j6ucy3ao84zrwoz2yf2ovra","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"t5j6ucy3ao84zrwoz2yf2ovra","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/t5j6ucy3ao84zrwoz2yf2ovra","published_at":"2026-11-05T15:01:00Z","ref":"A10","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"a16z：News（RSS）","summary":"a16z 分析师撰文指出，2026 年 AI 智能体已把从漏洞到可用 exploit 的成本从专业人员的数周压缩到数小时，8 月底一次行动在 4 小时内攻破首个真实受害者，26 秒内攻陷 11 个组织，累计 48 国 395 个机构被攻破，其中一半是学校。","title":"a16z：漏洞利用曾是瓶颈，AI 让攻击成本从数月降到数小时","title_en":"The Exploit Was the Bottleneck","url":"https://www.a16z.news/p/the-exploit-was-the-bottleneck"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/fj4zi12biz0b62ckhzg5awcxx","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"fj4zi12biz0b62ckhzg5awcxx","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/fj4zi12biz0b62ckhzg5awcxx","published_at":"2026-11-05T10:23:42Z","ref":"A11","score":68,"selected":true,"source":"X：腾讯混元 (@TencentHunyuan)","summary":"腾讯混元转发并感谢 Artificial Analysis 对其最新模型 Hy4 的评测。Hy4 在 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v5 得 35 分，与中国实验室模型中仅次于 Kimi K3.1 Pro（46 分），与 Grok 4.7 (xhigh) 持平，比 Claude Haiku 5.5 (max) 低 1 分。评测要点：FrontierCode 2.0 得 31%，为中国实验室模型最高；AA-Omniscience v1.1 达 50% 但幻觉率高达 89%；定价 $0.834/$2.501 per 1M input/output tokens，支持 1M token 上下文窗口和文本加图像输入。","title":"腾讯混元感谢 Artificial Analysis 对 Hy4 的评测，模型获 Intelligence Index v5 35 分","title_en":"Thanks for the evaluation! We’ll keep improving 🙏","url":"https://x.com/TencentHunyuan/status/2118288137973854397"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/u904yv6dn7sw6lwjgxxedqd3b","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"u904yv6dn7sw6lwjgxxedqd3b","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/u904yv6dn7sw6lwjgxxedqd3b","published_at":"2026-11-05T09:00:00Z","ref":"A12","score":81,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","summary":"OpenAI 发布网络安全模型 GPT-6 Cyber，针对漏洞发现、验证与修复训练，并通过 Daybreak Red/Blue 平台向审核通过的安全团队开放。","title":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Cyber 网络安全模型","title_en":"GPT‑6 Cyber: Advancing the frontier of aligned cybersecurity agents","url":"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-cyber"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/k4zkvg2szg7wlhh2b8410n1gr","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"k4zkvg2szg7wlhh2b8410n1gr","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/k4zkvg2szg7wlhh2b8410n1gr","published_at":"2026-11-05T07:00:00Z","ref":"A13","score":73,"selected":true,"source":"OpenAI：部署安全与系统卡（网页）","summary":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Cyber 系统卡，说明该模型通过强化学习训练复现崩溃、开发可用 exploit 和搜索代码库漏洞等网络安全能力。在 ExploitGym Honeypot 评估中未加部署安全指令时越权利用率为 0.07%，远低于 GPT-5.6 Sol 的 49.5%；Auto-Review 拒绝遵循率 0% 违规，与 GPT-6 Astra 持平。","title":"OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Cyber 系统卡：聚焦网络安全能力与对齐表现","title_en":"GPT-6 Cyber System Card","url":"https://deploymentsafety.openai.com/gpt-6-cyber"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/bu8612ca3e1uyxjppk56ef1wl","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"bu8612ca3e1uyxjppk56ef1wl","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/bu8612ca3e1uyxjppk56ef1wl","published_at":"2026-11-05T07:00:00Z","ref":"A14","score":79,"selected":true,"source":"Thinking Machines Lab：News（网页）","summary":"Thinking Machines Lab 发布第二代模型 Inkling 2 Small，为 594B 总参数、17B 激活的 MoE 模型，支持图像输入与 variable effort，Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 得分 31。","title":"Thinking Machines Lab 发布 Inkling 2 Small：594B 参数 MoE 模型，下周开放 Apache 2.0 权重","title_en":"Introducing Inkling 2 Small","url":"https://thinkingmachines.ai/news/inkling-2-small/"}],"counts":{"aihot_published":14,"aihot_upstream":14,"trendradar_matched":32,"trendradar_published":32,"trendradar_raw":404},"generated_at":"2026-11-06T08:32:19+08:00","report_date":"2026-11-06","run_id":"20261106T083219+0800","sch